1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters the Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 2=

10
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:02,180
(Imperial Medical Service)

11
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:05,940
Keep working.

12
00:01:06,550 --> 00:01:06,990
Yes.

13
00:01:16,380 --> 00:01:17,830
Miss Zheng has fully recovered.

14
00:01:18,150 --> 00:01:20,590
She is hosting a banquet to thank you
for saving her life.

15
00:01:20,830 --> 00:01:22,830
(Invitation to a Banquet)
Please do us the honor of attending.

16
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,860
Please convey my thanks to her.

17
00:01:25,020 --> 00:01:26,750
I will be there on time.

18
00:01:33,030 --> 00:01:33,830
Lord Zhao.

19
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,350
Once you attend the Censor Zheng
family's banquet of gratitude,

20
00:01:41,470 --> 00:01:42,750
your reputation here in the Capital

21
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:43,670
will be firmly established.

22
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:46,030
From now on,
at the Imperial Medical Service,

23
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:48,470
as long as the two of us work together,

24
00:01:48,670 --> 00:01:51,220
we are sure
to have a bright future ahead.

25
00:01:52,620 --> 00:01:54,260
I will always remember

26
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:56,940
your support, Lord Zhao.

27
00:02:01,140 --> 00:02:02,620
But I recently heard

28
00:02:03,110 --> 00:02:05,620
there seems to be some discord
in your household.

29
00:02:06,390 --> 00:02:07,780
If this continues,

30
00:02:08,180 --> 00:02:09,950
could it affect
your official reputation?

31
00:02:12,670 --> 00:02:15,620
It's nothing but petty disputes
among the women.

32
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:16,950
It's hardly worth mentioning.

33
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:17,950
Sir.

34
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,950
For a physician devoted
to mastering the healing arts,

35
00:02:21,030 --> 00:02:22,510
nothing matters more than peace of mind.

36
00:02:23,620 --> 00:02:25,260
If there is discord at home,

37
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,830
it will inevitably
disturb your peace of mind.

38
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:29,310
If you are willing,

39
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:32,230
perhaps I can be of some help.

40
00:02:32,830 --> 00:02:33,310
You...

41
00:02:35,230 --> 00:02:36,390
What could you possibly do?

42
00:02:37,470 --> 00:02:38,750
Matters between women

43
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:40,310
are often easier
for another woman to resolve.

44
00:02:41,310 --> 00:02:43,260
If you allow me to visit your residence

45
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:44,780
and tend to your wife's health,

46
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:46,620
once she is at ease,

47
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,830
peace will naturally return
to the household.

48
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:55,830
(She is on good terms
with the Zheng family.)

49
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,510
(Yet she has neither
power nor influence.)

50
00:02:58,260 --> 00:03:00,260
(Now is the perfect time
to bring her under my control.)

51
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:04,030
(If this can both
restore peace to my household)

52
00:03:04,140 --> 00:03:07,510
(and bind her more closely to my side,)

53
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:10,670
(wouldn't that solve
two problems at once?)

54
00:03:18,070 --> 00:03:18,420
Very well.

55
00:03:18,950 --> 00:03:20,740
I'll leave it to you.

56
00:03:21,070 --> 00:03:22,740
Come to my residence tomorrow.

57
00:03:23,740 --> 00:03:25,020
As you wish, Sir.

58
00:03:25,630 --> 00:03:26,020
Good.

59
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:30,950
(In this game between you and me,)

60
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:35,070
(I'll make sure you
lose more than just your pieces.)

61
00:03:35,620 --> 00:03:37,740
(Zhao Residence)

62
00:03:42,670 --> 00:03:43,190
Madam.

63
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:44,700
Medical Attendant Gu has arrived.

64
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:46,700
(Madam Zhao)

65
00:03:46,700 --> 00:03:47,700
I am Gu Hanyi.

66
00:03:47,830 --> 00:03:48,700
My respects to Madam Zhao.

67
00:03:50,190 --> 00:03:52,350
Thank you for coming all this way.

68
00:03:53,790 --> 00:03:55,020
As for my health,

69
00:03:55,580 --> 00:03:57,260
I'm merely getting through each day.

70
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:02,790
(Zhao Wujiu indulges himself
with other women.)

71
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,830
(He completely
neglects his wife, Madam Zhao.)

72
00:04:04,830 --> 00:04:06,860
(Their marriage exists in name only.)

73
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:09,950
Madam, your pulse is taut and uneven.

74
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,540
This is not an ailment
of the internal organs,

75
00:04:11,830 --> 00:04:13,070
but the result
of prolonged emotional distress.

76
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:14,390
Your liver qi
has been unable to flow freely.

77
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:17,140
And the decline in your qi and blood

78
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,580
is caused by prolonged poor nutrition.

79
00:04:20,510 --> 00:04:22,190
Poor nutrition?

80
00:04:25,510 --> 00:04:29,260
The fresh fruits and fine dishes

81
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:33,140
are all sent to Concubine Liu
in the west courtyard.

82
00:04:33,950 --> 00:04:34,860
As for me,

83
00:04:40,580 --> 00:04:43,110
I get nothing
but cold porridge and leftovers.

84
00:04:43,980 --> 00:04:45,510
Just enough to keep me from starving.

85
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:50,140
I'll administer acupuncture first

86
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:52,070
to clear the blocked meridians.

87
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:53,700
All right.

88
00:04:56,740 --> 00:04:58,190
A physician should care
for patients as a parent would.

89
00:04:58,740 --> 00:04:59,980
The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas

90
00:05:00,180 --> 00:05:02,220
(Cui Hong, Grand Secretary)
is a secret medical text.

91
00:05:02,580 --> 00:05:04,930
(Shen Ji, Deputy Director)
I cannot save my own family

92
00:05:04,930 --> 00:05:06,520
(of the Imperial Medical Service)
at the cost of plunging the people

93
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:08,190
into misery.

94
00:05:09,630 --> 00:05:11,700
Kill me if you must.

95
00:05:19,780 --> 00:05:20,430
Sir.

96
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:23,140
(The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas)

97
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:31,630
This is merely an ordinary medical text.

98
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:34,700
It isn't the epidemic volume
of The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas at all.

99
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:37,100
Dig.

100
00:05:39,070 --> 00:05:41,340
Search every brick in Shen Residence,

101
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:43,020
and every roof tile.

102
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,550
Bring me the formula,

103
00:05:46,510 --> 00:05:47,550
or at least a trace of its text.

104
00:05:48,750 --> 00:05:50,580
Yes. Understood.

105
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:51,510
Cui Hong.

106
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:53,070
If you still can't find
the epidemic volume,

107
00:05:53,310 --> 00:05:54,460
the next one to be sacrificed

108
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:56,830
will be you.

109
00:06:00,340 --> 00:06:01,310
Zhao Wujiu.

110
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:02,950
Cui Hong.

111
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,700
The man-eating flower.

112
00:06:07,700 --> 00:06:08,900
For the blood debt you owe,

113
00:06:10,070 --> 00:06:11,430
I will make each of you pay.

114
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:20,510
Your heart and spleen are both weakened,

115
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,100
leaving you deficient in qi and blood.

116
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,510
If this continues,

117
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,580
I'm afraid it will ruin your beauty.

118
00:06:25,660 --> 00:06:27,300
(Concubine Liu, Zhao Wujiu's concubine)
Ruin my beauty?

119
00:06:27,310 --> 00:06:28,070
I can't let that happen.

120
00:06:28,550 --> 00:06:29,750
Quick, do something about it.

121
00:06:33,380 --> 00:06:34,500
(Nourishing Vitality Pill)

122
00:06:36,310 --> 00:06:37,550
This is the Nourishing Vitality Pill,

123
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:39,220
made from a secret imperial formula.

124
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:42,170
(Nourishing Vitality Pill)
Taken regularly, it will restore a radiant complexion

125
00:06:42,170 --> 00:06:43,020
and nourish the skin.

126
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:48,780
Madam.

127
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:50,460
I'll take my leave now.

128
00:06:55,580 --> 00:06:58,220
(I'll start with you,)

129
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,850
(you pleasure-seeking concubine.)

130
00:07:04,550 --> 00:07:06,390
I've gained an initial foothold
in the Zhao household.

131
00:07:07,700 --> 00:07:10,310
Zhao Wujiu has taken
so many women by force

132
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:13,190
that even he can barely
remember them all.

133
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:15,220
Madam Zhao revealed...

134
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:19,780
The storeroom is piled high
with century-old ginseng

135
00:07:20,830 --> 00:07:23,070
and lingzhi from the snowy mountains,

136
00:07:24,390 --> 00:07:27,510
some of which may not
even be found in the palace.

137
00:07:28,950 --> 00:07:33,220
He secretly colludes with
medicine merchants outside the palace

138
00:07:33,830 --> 00:07:35,510
to line his own pockets.

139
00:07:36,390 --> 00:07:37,950
Madam Zhao is our way in.

140
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:39,630
A clever way to use
his own people against him

141
00:07:40,460 --> 00:07:41,630
and hollow out
his household from within.

142
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:42,900
That is indeed the best strategy.

143
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:44,830
This evidence

144
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:47,100
could become the blade
hanging over his head.

145
00:07:48,100 --> 00:07:49,870
You still need
to make the evidence conclusive.

146
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:52,070
Miss Hanyi.

147
00:07:56,990 --> 00:07:57,660
We found something.

148
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,660
Zhao Wujiu has close dealings
with Jishitang Apothecary

149
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:02,460
in the west of the Capital.

150
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:03,880
(March, Jishitang Profit Ledger)
On several occasions, valuable medicinal herbs

151
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:04,900
(March, Jishitang Profit Ledger)
from the Imperial Medical Service

152
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:06,460
were written off as inferior goods,

153
00:08:06,730 --> 00:08:08,120
but were actually
smuggled out of the palace

154
00:08:08,390 --> 00:08:09,990
and sold at high prices
through Jishitang Apothecary.

155
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:12,550
These are some of the names
involved and their transaction records.

156
00:08:16,580 --> 00:08:18,390
Concubine Liu's condition
is worsening by the day.

157
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:20,660
Zhao Wujiu has summoned
every renowned physician in the Capital,

158
00:08:20,780 --> 00:08:21,660
but none of them know what to do.

159
00:08:22,990 --> 00:08:24,750
The Zhao residence
is now rife with complaints.

160
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:29,430
It's time to make this mess even worse.

161
00:08:31,950 --> 00:08:33,430
Get out! All of you, get out!

162
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:35,550
Imperial physicians?
Renowned physicians?

163
00:08:35,900 --> 00:08:37,510
You're all completely useless!

164
00:08:37,510 --> 00:08:38,100
Madam.

165
00:08:38,310 --> 00:08:39,990
I'm so weak now

166
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:41,950
I can't even get out of bed.

167
00:08:45,430 --> 00:08:45,990
My lady.

168
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:49,580
Are you all deaf?

169
00:08:50,340 --> 00:08:51,390
Go find more!

170
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:53,020
Bring me the best physicians

171
00:08:53,190 --> 00:08:54,220
in the Capital!

172
00:08:54,830 --> 00:08:56,260
If none of them can cure her,

173
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:58,070
I'll have you all severely punished!

174
00:08:58,660 --> 00:08:59,460
Hurry!

175
00:08:59,460 --> 00:08:59,900
Yes!

176
00:08:59,900 --> 00:09:00,550
Yes, Master.

177
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:01,580
Quickly! Go!

178
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:04,430
The Nourishing Vitality Pill prescribed
by Medical Attendant Gu

179
00:09:05,020 --> 00:09:06,830
has proven quite effective.

180
00:09:07,830 --> 00:09:09,660
Medical Attendant Gu
is truly remarkable.

181
00:09:10,700 --> 00:09:11,260
Madam.

182
00:09:11,950 --> 00:09:12,550
It's all right.

183
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:14,510
Now that Concubine Liu has fallen ill,

184
00:09:15,140 --> 00:09:16,310
Master's attention

185
00:09:16,510 --> 00:09:17,990
will likely wander again

186
00:09:17,990 --> 00:09:19,190
in search of a new favorite.

187
00:09:19,700 --> 00:09:20,510
Let him.

188
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:24,460
The more chaotic things get, the easier
it is for us to make our move.

189
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:45,140
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

190
00:09:45,900 --> 00:09:48,840
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

191
00:09:49,500 --> 00:09:52,320
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

192
00:09:53,170 --> 00:09:56,160
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

193
00:09:57,010 --> 00:10:00,330
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

194
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:03,960
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

195
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:10,790
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

196
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:18,670
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

197
00:10:21,170 --> 00:10:29,020
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

198
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:31,130
♪I stand here today♪

199
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:35,780
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

200
00:10:35,780 --> 00:10:43,270
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

201
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:45,200
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

202
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:47,600
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

203
00:10:48,040 --> 00:10:54,890
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
